cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software

title: "Silukman Image Vectorizer"
abstract: >
  A PySide6 desktop application for high-quality raster-to-vector (SVG)
  conversion. Supports dual vectorization backends — Visioncortex VTracer
  (Rust-based spline tracing) and OpenCV contour-based engine — with
  preprocessing features including K-Means color quantization, background
  removal, palette replacement, and batch SVG export.

